/* GsDaedalusStormbow.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: arrows now fall from the sky, and a silver seal marks each landing point before the bolt strikes
	Shots build storm charge; at full charge the next shot lays a 3x3 sky matrix, corners then edges then center
	The center bolt lands heaviest and bursts on impact. Right click to release a partial matrix early
	Sky bolts stack hunt brands; branding a foe thrice calls a verdict bolt down upon it
	''' */
/* GsTsunami.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each draw looses a rank of 5 arrows that surge forward in a rolling wave, one ammo per draw
	Shots build tide charge; at full charge the next draw becomes a great wave: 7 piercing arrows in two ranks led by a sweeping foam crest
	Wave arrows stack tide brands; branding a foe thrice sends a water spout erupting beneath it
	While a branded foe stands, every 4th arrow splits off a tide-chaser that bites toward it
	''' */
/* GsFairyQueenRangedItem.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: all arrows become twilight lances; each sweep of the bow looses 5 lances along an arc, converging on the cursor
	The 3rd lance of every sweep is the Queen's lance, striking nearly twice as hard
	Shots build twilight; at full charge the next shot blooms into a prismatic fan of 5 lances
	Lance hits stack brands; branding a foe thrice calls twin fae orbs to circle and peck it for 2 seconds
	''' */
/* GsDD2BetsyBow.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each draw looses 5 dragonfire bolts that climb, stall, then dive-bomb the cursor area
	Impacts burst into dragonfire rings; airborne foes take 35% more damage
	Shots build airstrike charge; at full charge the next draw calls a carpet run of 9 bolts along the flight line
	Bolt hits stack flame brands; branding a foe thrice drops one heavy bomb straight onto it
	''' */
/* GsPhantasm.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hold to channel; fire rate climbs with frenzy, and the bow splits into phantom after-bows
	At frenzy rank 2 every volley gains two flanking phantom arrows
	Striking the same foe 6 times in a row calls a phantom archer to hover at your back and loose soul bolts alongside you
	Main arrows stack soul brands; branding a foe thrice makes the archer nail it with 4 homing soul bolts
	''' */
/* GsPearlwoodBow.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every 5 shots charge a rainbow arc volley, 5 arrows sweeping out one by one, one ammo per volley
	Landing 3 arc arrows on the same foe pops a pearl prism burst
	Right click releases the volley early at 60%+ charge
	''' */
/* GsCobaltRepeater.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses 3 bolts one after another that accelerate in flight, one ammo per volley
	Volley hits brand prey and grant you a short gust of Swiftness
	''' */
/* GsPalladiumRepeater.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 3-bolt line, one ammo per volley
	Branded foes slain restore 2 life; executions restore 5 more
	''' */
/* GsMythrilRepeater.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every 6th bolt triple-taps; volley charge looses a 4-bolt wedge, one ammo per volley
	The lead volley bolt always crits against branded foes; side bolts gain +8% crit
	''' */
